[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8941.03, "timestamp": "02:29:01", "text": "之类的关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8942.95, "timestamp": "02:29:02", "text": "他们早就知道我不喝酒，也不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8945.75, "timestamp": "02:29:05", "text": "抽烟。 我不。是的。 喝酒或抽烟之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8957.99, "timestamp": "02:29:17", "text": "我大概15岁的时候去了卡纳卡的一家"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8967.83, "timestamp": "02:29:27", "text": "然后18岁就出来了。这很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8970.23, "timestamp": "02:29:30", "text": "我的意思是，我年轻的时候尝试过所有这些方法，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8973.349, "timestamp": "02:29:33", "text": "我想是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8979.51, "timestamp": "02:29:39", "text": "因为我必须融入群体，对吧？因为是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8982.23, "timestamp": "02:29:42", "text": "我不想在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8985.59, "timestamp": "02:29:45", "text": "课堂上被孤立，就像教室里只有一个怪人独自"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8987.99, "timestamp": "02:29:47", "text": "坐着一样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8992.79, "timestamp": "02:29:52", "text": "我想融入群体，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8997.429, "timestamp": "02:29:57", "text": "嗯，是的，所以我以前也这样做过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.03, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "是的。"}]